| ms_triangles_v9b | triangle_count | 5 | 1 | 100.0% | 100.0% – 100.0% | 100.0% | 100% | 0 | 5 | 0 | 9546 | 12.3s |

accuracy = share of all answers (every run) that were correct; 95% CI = bootstrap over questions; strict = accuracy without answers rescued from text tool calls; checked = answers a checker actually looked at; no answer = runs that ended without one (cannot_answer, loop, max steps, context full, error); rejected = answers a checker sent back; compacted = runs whose conversation was shortened to fit the context window; tokens / q = prompt + completion tokens per answer.

